      "value": "@{58c6b3cc227a56787575ebb4|full_name}: That owner, which btw information is actully visible in my world menu anyway so its not a secret, master is unknown and in 90% cases its always a problem to figure out who is it and you dont know master exclusive feature in world is actully broken.",
