  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think the title speaks for itself. Usually, it's hard to find who's the master of an instance, and, besides that, when the creator/owner comes as a moderator to their world, most people don't expect them to be able to kick others, which is why regular users don't behave until they get a warning from the moderator. Hopefully, recognizing moderators will improve the community's behavior.",
